The following are **recipes, not executed commands or inferred results**. The supplied observations are fixed.

**Execution prerequisites:** the absolute owning checkout, absolute home checkout, installed skill/reference paths, and amendment-surface grant/menu rules must be available before dispatch. `/workspace/project` in a document path does **not** establish a worktree. If those prerequisites are missing, stop; do not infer them.

Use these bindings once established:

```text
OWNING_CHECKOUT = <absolute owning worktree>
HOME_CHECKOUT = <absolute home worktree>
PLAN_SKILL = <absolute writing-plans/SKILL.md>
PLAN_CONTRACT = <absolute plan-contract reference>
AMENDMENT_SURFACE = <absolute brainstorming/reference/amendment-surface.md>

planPath = /workspace/project/doc/plans/feature.md
Spec = /workspace/project/doc/specs/feature.md
anchor = ### Task 4:
```

Read the installed skill resources at their absolute paths, including the dispatch contract, implement amendments, and amendment surface. Do not read plan/spec/source contents in the primary.

## 1. Amend-prepare

Establish a report directory using primary shell coordination:

```bash
REPORT_DIR=$(mktemp -d) || exit 1
printf 'report-dir: %s\n' "$REPORT_DIR"
```

Use the printed path in subsequent carriers; do not rely on shell variables surviving calls.

These are the relevant schema bindings:

```js
const PREPARE_SCHEMA = {
  type: "object",
  required: ["items", "redraws"],
  additionalProperties: false,
  properties: {
    items: {
      type: "array",
      items: {
        type: "object",
        required: ["evidence", "recommended", "location", "edit"],
        additionalProperties: false,
        properties: {
          evidence: { type: "string" },
          recommended: { type: "string", pattern: "^(accept|alt-[0-9]+)$" },
          location: { type: "string" },
          edit: { type: "string" }
        }
      }
    },
    redraws: {
      type: "array",
      items: {
        type: "object",
        required: ["location", "reason"],
        additionalProperties: false,
        properties: {
          location: { type: "string" },
          reason: { type: "string", maxLength: 300 }
        }
      }
    }
  }
};

const ANSWER_SCHEMA = {
  type: "object",
  required: ["answer", "evidence"],
  additionalProperties: false,
  properties: {
    answer: { type: "string" },
    evidence: { type: "array", items: { type: "string" } }
  }
};

const APPLY_SCHEMA = {
  type: "object",
  required: [
    "amendedSections", "tasksAdded", "tasksAnchorChanged",
    "tasksRemoved", "passed"
  ],
  additionalProperties: false,
  properties: {
    amendedSections: { type: "array", items: { type: "string" } },
    tasksAdded: { type: "array", items: { type: "integer" } },
    tasksAnchorChanged: { type: "array", items: { type: "integer" } },
    tasksRemoved: { type: "array", items: { type: "integer" } },
    passed: { type: "boolean" },
    failLines: { type: "array", items: { type: "string" } }
  }
};
```

Foreground, fresh-context, one-step preparation:

```js
subagent({
  async: false,
  context: "fresh",
  cwd: OWNING_CHECKOUT,
  chain: [{
    parallel: [{
      agent: "plan-writer",
